  '<div class="panel"><h2>Log food in a proper app</h2>'+
    '<div class="note" style="border-top:none">This app deliberately has no food diary. A database and a barcode '+
      'scanner beat anything typed by hand. Worth checking: Cronometer, FatSecret, MacroFactor, MyFitnessPal. '+
