    '<div class="row"><span class="k">19:45</span><span class="tiny">Dinner</span></div>'+
    '<div class="note">Pack the bag the night before on a five-shift week. A sandwich, crisps and a bar is about '+
      '700 kcal for 20 g of protein, which is a third of your calories for a sixth of your protein.</div>'+
  '</div>'+

  '<div class="panel"><h2>No-counting version</h2>'+
