    '<div class="row"><span class="k">Carbs</span><span class="v">1 cupped hand</span></div>'+
    '<div class="row"><span class="k">Fats</span><span class="v">1 thumb</span></div>'+
    '<div class="note">Four meals a day. Track properly for two or three weeks first, then switch to this. '+
      'By then you will know what 130 g of protein looks like on a plate.</div>'+
  '</div>';
